  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>The duration of the day <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>86400</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mo>&#8771;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>5</mn></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></math></p><p>revolution period&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>365</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>days</mi><mo>&#8771;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>7</mn></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></math></p><p>For&nbsp;the light of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn><mn>0</mn><mn>0</mn><mn>0</mn></math>&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>A</mi><mn>0</mn></msup></math>,&nbsp;time period<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8771;</mo><mn>1</mn><msup><mn>0</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mn>5</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></math>&nbsp;and</p><p>for the sound wave&nbsp;time period<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8771;</mo><mn>1</mn><msup><mn>0</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></math></p>"
